From edd45a4ea7f82519d014445cacaef178cafa3154 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:38:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] QR codes: per-piece PNG/SVG download and a printable label
 sheet

Codes encode the permanent <artist website>/qr/<inventory #> link, which
the artist's website redirects to the work's current page.

- src/lib/qr.ts, src/components/PieceQr.tsx (piece page panel)
- src/pages/QrLabels.tsx at reports/labels: choose works, label size,
  paper, gap, which text to include; prints at real millimetres
- three one-line hooks: route in main.tsx, link in Reports, panel in PieceEdit
- dependency: qrcode

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UB9rTyDSgS1q8Zs3ZHd5Yj
